card.statement:
For $(X_0, X_1; Y_0, Y_1; v_1, w_1) \in \mathfrak{M}_{\z_2}^\tau(n-k,n; \, \mathrm{0})$ we have

\begin{equation}
\kappa \, = \, 1+ \sum_{l=1}^{2k} B_l \, y^{-l}x^{-l} \, ,
\end{equation}

where

\begin{eqnarray}
B_{2l-1}&=&-  \begin{pmatrix}
k+l-1 \\
2l-1
\end{pmatrix}
\prod_{r=2}^{2l-1} \big( (k+l-r)
\tau_0 +(k+l-r+1)\tau_1 \big) \nonumber \\[0.2cm]
&&\times  \bigg( (k+l-1)\tau_0 +(k+l)\tau_1+\frac{(n-k^2-k)(2l-1)}{k+l-1}(\tau_0+\tau_1)\bigg) ,
\nonumber \\[0.2cm]
B_{2l}&=& \begin{pmatrix}
k+l \\
2l
\end{pmatrix}   \prod_{r=1}^{2l-1}
\big( (k+l-r-1)\tau_0 +(k+l-r)\tau_1 \big)\nonumber \\[0.2cm]
&&\times  \bigg( (k+ l-1)\tau_0+(k+l)\tau_1 +\frac{(n-k^2-k)(2l)}{k+l}
(\tau_0+\tau_1)\bigg).
\end{eqnarray}
